#. ja: ディアデム諸島で採れるイシュガルド復興用資材。<br>嵐霊風時のみ採集可能<br>[イシュガルド復興事業専用][検品済み]<br>[高難易度レシピ用]
#. de: Rohmaterial aus dem Diadem für den Wieder<shy>aufbau der Himmelsstadt. (Für Aufträge des Wieder<shy>aufbaus Ishgards.)<br>Materialkontrolle abgeschlossen und regulär verwendbar.<br>Zur Herstellung von Expertenrezepten.
#. fr: Une ressource du Diadème destinée au chantier d'Azurée. On ne la trouve là-bas que lorsqu'un vent ombral des tempêtes souffle sur le chapelet d'îles.<br>[Réservé à la recon<shy>struc<shy>tion d'Ishgard][Déjà expertisé]<br>[Pour recette avancée]
#. column 0: approved grade 4 skybuilders' umbral galewood branch
#. column 2: approved grade 4 skybuilders' umbral galewood branches
#. column 9: Approved Grade 4 Skybuilders' Umbral Galewood Branch
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:32001:0:8"
msgid "The billowing wind-aspected aether that surrounds this branch might lead some to think it would be the ideal material from which to make a magic wand. Unfortunately, the energies within it are so powerful, the wielder would struggle to even hold on to it long enough to cast any spells before it blows right out of their hands.<br><br>Can only be gathered during an umbral tempest.<br><br>Used in expert crafting recipes."
msgstr ""

