#. de: Fläschchen[p] Krypta-Lösungsmittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent renforçant de rôdeur des cryptes
#. column 2: flasks of crypt ester
#. column 8: An unwholesome-looking yet effective potion concocted by the innovative artisans of the Crystalline Mean. When applied with exacting care, this pungent solvent removes impurities from cryptlurker weapons, allowing their finer attributes to rise more fully to the surface. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Crypt Ester
